{"dog":{"age_group":"adult","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","breed_primary":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","description_text":"My foster writes:\n\nI may look like Batman with my perfect mask, but I am cautious and somewhat scared. I've improved over time but any sudden movements or the doorbell indicating a stranger on the other side of the door, will have me running for safety. Even when I'm scared, my foster has never once heard me hiss, and I do not bite or scratch. Instead, I'll either hide or freeze in the hope that I'll become invisible.\n\nThe secret to stealing my heart is to just love me a lot and give me space and encouragement. If you do, I'll let my guard down enough to invite you to pet me; I'll follow you around; I may even sleep next to you if you're ok with that; and I'll zoom from one end of the home to the next when I'm in my extra happy place. Another happy place for me is a window with a view. I'll start the day by checking out what's happening in the world outside, have my breakfast, take a nap, or two, and later on you'll most likely find me back at the windowsill taking another nap or checking to see if anything new has happened since I last sat there ðŸ™‚\n\nI may never become that furbaby who curls up in your lap to nap but the best thing about me is that I am as gentle as I am cute!","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=2%2C15&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=2&searchType=4&animalid=165894","id":"17c9ea70aa6ce511dfc4da1b3b571cef","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/709aeac6b07543878f02669093c3f0c4-1795646936-1795646952-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/eabf416c9d1648b09ac26263abc9dcaa-1795646939-1795646939-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/f52ed520503c429586c7ccc2ba4d6ce2-1795646938-17